  "body": "I was trying to find out which ports are used by fetch when none are specified. \r\n\r\nAnd while browsers seem to use 80 and 443 as might be expected I was surprised not to find this specified anywhere. But why 80/443 when payloads are unlikely to be HTML?\r\n\r\nIn fact this appears to be true of any request mechanism I looked at.",
